# Experiments

This directory contains reproducible experiment notebooks and result summaries.

## Notebooks

| Notebook | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `01_compaction_file_stats.ipynb` | Compare file count, average file size, query time before/after `rewrite_data_files` |
| `02_mor_delete_file_check.ipynb` | Check data/delete file distribution for MOR tables and test `rewrite_position_delete_files` |
| `03_rewrite_manifests_check.ipynb` | Compare manifest count before/after `rewrite_manifests` |

## Results

Result summaries are stored in `results/*.md`.